# The speech library ships with the package, so it has to be in the repository.
# Upstream's root .gitignore excludes *.dll, which silently kept it out of every
# commit: the local build found it on disk and the CI packaging step did not.
# A rule in this folder wins over the one above it, and this file is ours, so
# upstream's .gitignore stays untouched and off the conflict surface.
!nvdaControllerClient.dll
